MerkleAdapter signatures
├── sign
│   ├── rejects direct callers including the owner
│   ├── requires the current Merkle proof and leaf role
│   ├── computes the digest from the approved domain and explicit EIP-712 fields
│   ├── stores an approval flag and emits the digest, preimage and hash program
│   └── rolls back approval when a Recipe check fails
├── revokeSignature
│   ├── permits the owner after the root and all its roles are cleared
│   ├── rejects non-owners even with default-admin and leaf roles
│   ├── rejects account self-calls even with a valid leaf and role
│   ├── transfers cancellation authority with account ownership
│   ├── emits no event for an absent approval and permits later approval again
│   └── clears only the selected digest
└── isValidSignature
    ├── returns magic only for approved digests and ignores callback bytes
    ├── snapshots both approved and unknown-digest callbacks
    ├── cannot approve an unrelated caller-supplied digest
    ├── preserves independent approvals
    └── root and role changes preserve approvals until explicitly revoked
